# Opusly

Opusly is a full-stack web application built to explore and implement real-world web development concepts using modern JavaScript technologies.  
The project is structured with a separate frontend and backend and is designed to be scalable and collaborative.

This repository is intended for learning, experimentation, and team-based development.

---

## Tech Stack

### Frontend
- React
- JavaScript
- CSS

### Backend
- Node.js
- Express.js

### Database
- MongoDB

### Tools & DevOps
- Docker
- Docker Compose
- Git & GitHub

